    "id": 3,
    "label": "Problem 3",
    "statement": "Design a Turing machine that multiplies its input by three in tally notation, building on your solution to the x + 3 problem. The tape starts with a single block of strokes representing x, with the head on the rightmost stroke, and the machine must halt leaving a single block of 3x strokes in standard position.",
